# Cookies

Cookies are small files that a website saves on your phone, tablet or computer. This site uses one essential cookie. It does not use analytics or advertising cookies.

## Essential cookie

The site saves this cookie when you select **Hide this notice** on the first-visit notice. It remembers that you have hidden the notice, so that the notice does not appear on every page.

| Name | Purpose | Expires |
| --- | --- | --- |
| `civica_docs_notice` | Remembers the version of the notice you have hidden | After 1 year |

The cookie contains no account details, household details or anything that identifies you. It works only on this site. It is not shared between browsers or devices.

Hiding the notice is an acknowledgement. It is not consent to tracking, because the site does not track you.

## Cookies we do not use

This site does not use:

* analytics cookies
* advertising cookies
* cookies from other companies that follow you across websites

You do not need to choose between cookie settings, because there are no optional cookies to turn on or off.

## If your browser blocks cookies

You can still read every page. If your browser blocks cookies, the notice hides for the page you are on and may appear again when you go to another page.

If JavaScript is switched off, the notice stays visible and the **Hide this notice** button is not shown. All the information on this site remains available.

## Remove the cookie

To make the notice appear again, delete the `civica_docs_notice` cookie in your browser settings. How you do this depends on your browser. Search your browser's help for "delete cookies for one site".

## Other websites

GitHub hosts this site. GitHub may keep technical logs of visits, which are separate from the cookie on this page. Read the [Privacy notice](privacy.html) for details. Links to other websites, and map or chart examples that load from other providers, are covered by those providers' own cookie and privacy information.

## Changes to this page

If the cookies on this site change, this page changes first. Each change is listed in the page history and in the public [Civica repository](https://github.com/nathcymru/civica).
